---
import { getLocaleFromUrl, t, getLocalePath } from '../i18n/utils';

const locale = getLocaleFromUrl(Astro.url);
const i = t(locale);
---

<div class="relative bg-[#070A12] text-white py-20 px-6 sm:px-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
  <div class="mb-12">
    <a href={getLocalePath(locale, '')} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-[#8B55FA] hover:text-[#C4B5FD] transition-colors mb-6">
      ← Back to Home
    </a>
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4">
      {locale === 'zh-CN' ? 'viLilt 隐私保护政策' : locale === 'zh-TW' ? 'viLilt 隱私保護政策' : 'viLilt Privacy Policy'}
    </h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm font-mono">
      {locale === 'zh-CN' ? '生效日期：2026 年 9 月 · 100% 端侧本地执行声明' : locale === 'zh-TW' ? '生效日期：2026 年 9 月 · 100% 端側本地執行聲明' : 'Effective Date: September 2026 · 100% On-Device Commitment'}
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-8 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed text-sm">
    <div class="bg-[#0E1322] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">
        {locale === 'zh-CN' ? '1. 我们的核心原则：数据零出端' : locale === 'zh-TW' ? '1. 我們的核心原則：數據零出端' : '1. Core Principle: Zero Data Leaves Your Device'}
      </h2>
      <p>
        {locale === 'zh-CN' 
          ? 'viLilt 由 viaiforgood.org (非营利) 与 VI AI INC 联合打造。我们坚信语音与对话是人类最私密的心灵交流。viLilt 从架构第一行代码起即设计为 100% 离线端侧运行。'
          : locale === 'zh-TW'
          ? 'viLilt 由 viaiforgood.org (非營利) 與 VI AI INC 聯合打造。我們堅信語音與對話是人類最私密的心靈交流。viLilt 從架構第一行代碼起即設計為 100% 離線端側運行。'
          : 'viLilt is jointly developed by viaiforgood.org (Nonprofit) and VI AI INC. We believe voice conversation is an intrinsically private human experience. viLilt is engineered from ground zero to execute 100% on-device.'}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-[#0E1322] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">
        {locale === 'zh-CN' ? '2. 语音识别与模型推理' : locale === 'zh-TW' ? '2. 語音識別與模型推理' : '2. Speech Recognition & Neural Inference'}
      </h2>
      <p>
        {locale === 'zh-CN'
          ? '您的麦克风音频流直接由 Apple iOS 原生 Speech 引擎与本地轻量神经网络模型 (GGUF) 在手机芯片上实时处理。您的录音从不上传至任何云端服务器，亦不用于任何第三方 AI 模型训练。'
          : locale === 'zh-TW'
          ? '您的麥克風音訊流直接由 Apple iOS 原生 Speech 引擎與本地輕量神經網路模型 (GGUF) 在手機晶片上即時處理。您的錄音從不上傳至任何雲端伺服器，亦不用于任何第三方 AI 模型訓練。'
          : 'Your microphone audio stream is processed directly by Apple iOS on-device Speech APIs and local GGUF models on Apple Silicon. Audio recordings are never uploaded to cloud servers or used for third-party model training.'}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-[#0E1322] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">
        {locale === 'zh-CN' ? '3. 零遥测与零分析追踪' : locale === 'zh-TW' ? '3. 零遙測與零分析追蹤' : '3. Zero Telemetry & Zero Analytics'}
      </h2>
      <p>
        {locale === 'zh-CN'
          ? 'viLilt 不包含任何第三方广告 SDK、遥测 SDK、数据分析跟踪器或用户画像收集组件。'
          : locale === 'zh-TW'
          ? 'viLilt 不包含任何第三方廣告 SDK、遙測 SDK、數據分析追蹤器或使用者畫像收集組件。'
          : 'viLilt contains no third-party advertising SDKs, tracking frameworks, user profiling telemetry, or surveillance analytics.'}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-[#0E1322] border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">
        {locale === 'zh-CN' ? '4. 联络与反馈' : locale === 'zh-TW' ? '4. 聯絡與反饋' : '4. Contact & Security Inquiries'}
      </h2>
      <p>
        {locale === 'zh-CN'
          ? '如对本政策或本地隐私机制有任何疑问，请随时联系：developer@viai.ai 或 developer@viaiforgood.org。'
          : locale === 'zh-TW'
          ? '如對本政策或本地隱私機制有任何疑問，請隨時聯繫：developer@viai.ai 或 developer@viaiforgood.org。'
          : 'If you have any questions regarding privacy or local security architecture, contact us at: developer@viai.ai or developer@viaiforgood.org.'}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
